leUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>4/16/2007. Venue type: school. Killed: 32. Injured: 23. Total victims: 55. Virginia Tech student Seung-Hui Cho, 23, opened fire on his school&#x27;s campus before committing suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/2007/04/24/us/24virginia.html; http://www.thestandard.com.hk/news_detail.asp?we_cat=9&amp;art_id=4248....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2007-04-16</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-80.41394,37.22957,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Crandon shooting - Crandon, Wisconsin</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>10/7/2007. Venue type: other. Killed: 6. Injured: 1. Total victims: 7. Off-duty sheriff&#x27;s deputy Tyler Peterson, 20, opened fire inside an apartment after an argument at a homecoming party. He fled the scene and later committed suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.rivernewsonline.com/main.asp?SectionID=6&amp;SubSectionID=47&amp;ArticleID=368; http://news.google.com/newspapers?id=....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2007-10-07</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-88.90289,45.57191,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Westroads Mall shooting - Omaha, Nebraska</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>12/5/2007. Venue type: other. Killed: 9 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 8 victims killed). Injured: 4. Total victims: 13. Robert A. Hawkins, 19, opened fire inside Westroads Mall before committing suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.guardian.co.