ootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>6/25/2008. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 6 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 5 victims killed). Injured: 1. Total victims: 7. Disgruntled employee Wesley Neal Higdon, 25, shot up an Atlantis Plastics factory after he was escorted out of his workplace for an argument with a supervisor. Higdon shot the supervisor outside the factory before opening fire on coworkers inside. He then committed suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.foxnews.com/story/0,2933,371242,00.html; http://www.msnbc.msn.com/id/25393695/ns/us_news-crime_and_courts/t/w....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2008-06-25</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-87.63897,37.80422,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Carthage nursing home shooting - Carthage, North Carolina</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>3/29/2009. Venue type: other. Killed: 8. Injured: 3. Total victims: 11. Robert Stewart, 45, opened fire at a nursing home where his estranged wife worked before he was shot and arrested by a police officer. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.wral.com/news/local/story/9845639/; http://www.wral.com/news/local/story/4837676/.</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2009-03-29</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-79.41459,35.33343,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Binghamton shootings - Binghamton, New York</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>4/3/2009. Venue type: other. Killed: 14 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 13 victims killed). Injured: 4. Total victims: 18. Jiverly Wong, 41, opened fire at an American Civic Association center for immigrants before committing suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/2009/04/12/nyregion/12binghamton.html?pagewanted=all&amp;_r=0; http://www.nytimes.com/2009/04/04/nyre....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2009-04-03</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-75.91772,42.0998,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Fort Hood massacre - Fort Hood, Texas</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>11/5/2009. Venue type: military. Killed: 13. Injured: 31. Total victims: 44. Army psychiatrist Nidal Malik Hasan, 39, opened fire on an Army base in an attack linked to Islamist extremism. Hasan was injured during the attack and later arrested. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://seattletimes.com/html/nationworld/2010232219_apusforthoodshooting.html; http://articles.latimes.com/2010/oct/21/n....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2009-11-05</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-97.78366,31.13556,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Coffee shop police killings - Parkland, Washington</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>11/29/2009. Venue type: other. Killed: 4. Injured: 1. Total victims: 5. Maurice Clemmons, 37, a felon who was out on bail for child-rape charges, entered a coffee shop on a Sunday morning and shot four police officers who had gone there to use their laptops before their shifts. Clemmons, who was wounded fleeing the scene, was later shot dead by a police officer in Seattle after a two-day manhunt. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://seattletimes.com/html/localnews/2010385617_webmansought29.html; http://www.nytimes.com/2009/11/30/us/30tacoma.htm....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2009-11-29</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-122.46731,47.15277,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Hartford Beer Distributor shooting - Manchester, Connecticut</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>8/3/2010. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 9 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 8 victims killed). Injured: 2. Total victims: 11. Omar S. Thornton, 34, shot up his Hartford Beer Distributor workplace after facing disciplinary issues, then committed suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.cbsnews.com/8301-504083_162-20012557-504083.html; http://www.msnbc.msn.com/id/38535909/ns/us_news-crime_and_c....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2010-08-03</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-72.57007,41.79876,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Tucson shooting - Tucson, Arizona</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>1/8/2011. Venue type: other. Killed: 6. Injured: 13. Total victims: 19. Jared Loughner, 22, opened fire outside a Safeway during a constituent meeting with Congresswoman Gabrielle Giffords (D-Ariz.) before he was subdued by bystanders and arrested. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.time.com/time/magazine/article/0,9171,2042358,00.html; http://www.csmonitor.com/USA/Politics/2011/0110/Why-Ja....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2011-01-08</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-110.97513,32.33594,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>IHOP shooting - Carson City, Nevada</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>9/6/2011. Venue type: other. Killed: 5 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 4 victims killed). Injured: 7. Total victims: 12. Eduardo Sencion, 32, opened fire at an International House of Pancakes restaurant and later died from a self-inflicted gunshot wound. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.huffingtonpost.com/2011/11/03/eduardo-sencion-ihop-shooter_n_1073677.html; http://www.lasvegassun.com/news/20....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2011-09-06</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-119.7695,39.1313,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Seal Beach shooting - Seal Beach, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>10/12/2011. Venue type: other. Killed: 8. Injured: 1. Total victims: 9. Scott Evans Dekraai, 42, opened fire inside a hair salon and was later arrested. Victims killed in the attack included his ex-wife, who Dekraai had a history of violently abusing, according to court records. The two had also been involved in a bitter custody battle. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://laist.com/2011/10/13/seal_beach_shooter_suffered_from_ptsd.php; http://blogs.ocweekly.com/navelgazing/2011/10/hai....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2011-10-12</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-118.10464,33.74118,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Su Jung Health Sauna shooting - Norcross, Georgia</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>2/21/2012. Venue type: other. Killed: 5 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 4 victims killed). Injured: 0. Total victims: 5. Jeong Soo Paek, 59, returned to a Korean spa from which he&#x27;d been kicked out after an altercation. He gunned down two of his sisters and their husbands before committing suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.gwinnettdailypost.com/news/2012/feb/23/police-id-4-victims-shooter-in-spa-killing/; http://www.cbsnews.com/83....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2012-02-21</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-84.21353,33.94121,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Oikos University killings - Oakland, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>4/2/2012. Venue type: school. Killed: 7. Injured: 3. Total victims: 10. One L. Goh, 43, a former student, opened fire in a nursing classroom. He fled the scene by car and was arrested nearby a few hours later. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://blog.sfgate.com/eguillermo/2012/04/05/something-still-doesnt-compute-in-the-one-goh-nightmare/; http://www.mercur....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2012-04-02</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-122.2025,37.74167,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Seattle cafe shooting - Seattle, Washington</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>5/30/2012. Venue type: other. Killed: 6 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 5 victims killed). Injured: 1. Total victims: 7. Ian Stawicki, 40, gunned down four patrons at a cafe, and another person during a carjacking nearby, then shot himself as police closed in. (He died later that day in a Seattle hospital.) Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://usnews.nbcnews.com/_news/2012/05/30/11959312-six-killed-in-seattle-shootings-including-suspect?lite; http://www.c....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2012-05-30</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-122.31722,47.67139,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Aurora theater shooting - Aurora, Colorado</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>7/20/2012. Venue type: other. Killed: 12. Injured: 70. Total victims: 82. James Holmes, 24, opened fire in a movie theater during the opening night of &quot;The Dark Night Rises&quot; and was later arrested outside. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.cbsnews.com/8301-201_162-57497820/james-holmes-saw-three-mental-health-professionals-before-shooting/; http:/....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2012-07-20</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-104.82059,39.70604,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Sikh temple shooting - Oak Creek, Wisconsin</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>8/5/2012. Venue type: religious. Killed: 7 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 6 victims killed). Injured: 3. Total victims: 10. U.S. Army veteran Wade Michael Page, 40, opened fire in a Sikh gurdwara before he died from a self-inflicted gunshot wound during a shootout with police. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.jsonline.com/news/milwaukee/friend-of-page-feared-what-he-might-do-426edmg-165668826.html; http://usnews.nbcn....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2012-08-05</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-87.91083,42.90806,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Accent Signage Systems shooting - Minneapolis, Minnesota</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>9/27/2012. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 7 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 6 victims killed). Injured: 1. Total victims: 8. Andrew Engeldinger, 36, upon learning he was being fired, went on a shooting rampage, killing the business owner, three fellow employees, and a UPS driver. He then killed himself. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.startribune.com/local/171774461.html?refer=y.</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2012-09-27</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-93.31041,44.97742,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Sandy Hook Elementary massacre - Newtown, Connecticut</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>12/14/2012. Venue type: school. Killed: 27. Injured: 2. Total victims: 29. Adam Lanza, 20, shot his mother dead at their home then drove to Sandy Hook Elementary school. He forced his way inside and opened fire, killing 20 children and six adults before committing suicide. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://usnews.nbcnews.com/_news/2012/12/14/15911025-authorities-id-gunman-who-killed-27-in-elementary-school-massacre?li....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2012-12-14</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-73.31142,41.41232,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Mohawk Valley shootings - Herkimer County, New York</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>3/13/2013. Venue type: other. Killed: 5 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 4 victims killed). Injured: 2. Total victims: 7. Kurt Myers, 64, shot six people in neighboring towns, killing two in a barbershop and two at a car care business, before being killed by officers in a shootout after a nearly 19-hour standoff. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.nyspnews.com/article_display.cfm?article_id=29584.</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2013-03-13</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-74.98489,43.0456,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Pinewood Village Apartment shooting - Federal Way, Washington</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>4/21/2013. Venue type: other. Killed: 5 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 4 victims killed). Injured: 0. Total victims: 5. Dennis Clark III, 27, shot and killed his girlfriend in their shared apartment, and then shot two witnesses in the building&#x27;s parking lot and a third victim in another apartment, before being killed by police. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://seattletimes.com/html/localnews/2020836119_federalwayshootingxml.html.</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2013-04-21</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-122.33937,47.31296,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Santa Monica rampage - Santa Monica, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>6/7/2013. Venue type: other. Killed: 6 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 5 victims killed). Injured: 3. Total victims: 9. John Zawahri, 23, armed with a homemade assault rifle and high-capacity magazines, killed his brother and father at home and then headed to Santa Monica College, where he was eventually killed by police. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.cbsnews.com/8301-504083_162-57589327-504083/john-zawahri-suspected-gunman-in-deadly-santa-monica-shooting-lef....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2013-06-07</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-118.49475,34.00862,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Hialeah apartment shooting - Hialeah, Florida</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>7/26/2013. Venue type: other. Killed: 7 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 6 victims killed). Injured: 0. Total victims: 7. Pedro Vargas, 42, set fire to his apartment, killed six people in the complex, and held another two hostages at gunpoint before a SWAT team stormed the building and fatally shot him. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.miamiherald.com/2013/07/27/v-print/3526078/a-look-at-the-victims-in-the-hialeah.html http://www.cbsnews.com/8....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2013-07-26</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-80.31177,25.86434,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Washington Navy Yard shooting - Washington, D.C.</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>9/16/2013. Venue type: military. Killed: 12. Injured: 8. Total victims: 20. Aaron Alexis, 34, a military veteran and contractor from Texas, opened fire in the Navy installation, killing 12 people and wounding 8 before being shot dead by police. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/2013/09/18/us/state-law-stopped-gunman-from-buying-rifle-officials-say.html; http://edition.cnn.c....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2013-09-16</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-76.99453,38.87498,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Alturas tribal shooting - Alturas, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>2/20/2014. Venue type: other. Killed: 4. Injured: 2. Total victims: 6. Cherie Lash Rhoades, 44, opened fire at the Cedarville Rancheria Tribal Office and Community Center, killing four and wounding two. After running out of ammunition, Rhoades grabbed a butcher knife and stabbed another person. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.sacbee.com/news/local/crime/article2603350.html; http://www.csmonitor.com/USA/2014/0223/Alturas-tribal-shooti....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2014-02-20</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-120.54224,41.4871,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Fort Hood shooting 2 - Fort Hood, Texas</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>4/2/2014. Venue type: military. Killed: 3. Injured: 12. Total victims: 15. Army Specialist Ivan Lopez, 34, opened fire at the Fort Hood Army Post in Texas, killing three and wounding at least 12 others before shooting himself in the head after engaging with military police. Lt. Gen. Mark A. Milley told reporters that Lopez &quot;had behavioral health and mental health&quot; issues. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.cnn.com/2014/04/02/us/fort-hood-shooting/ and https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/checkpoint/wp/2015/01/23/ar....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2014-04-02</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-97.77756,31.14172,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Isla Vista mass murder - Santa Barbara, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>5/23/2014. Venue type: school. Killed: 6. Injured: 13. Total victims: 19. Elliot Rodger, 22, shot three people to death in the college town of Isla Vista near the University of California, Santa Barbara. He also shot others as he drove around town, and injured others by striking them with is vehicle. He committed suicide by shooting himself in his car as police closed in. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.sbsheriff.us/documents/ISLAVISTAINVESTIGATIVESUMMARY.pdf Also: http://www.cnn.com/2014/05/24/us/santa-barbara....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2014-05-23</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-119.87144,34.43628,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Marysville-Pilchuck High School shooting - Marysville, Washington</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>10/24/2014. Venue type: school. Killed: 5 (MJ count, includes the perpetrator; 4 victims killed). Injured: 1. Total victims: 6. Jaylen Fryberg, 15, using a .40-caliber Berretta, shot five students at Marysville High School, including two of his cousins and three friends, killing all but one. Fryberg arranged to meet them for lunch in the school cafeteria by text. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.seattletimes.com/seattle-news/fourth-marysville-shooting-victim-dies-as-another-is-laid-to-rest/ http://www.m....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2014-10-24</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-122.15454,48.09599,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Trestle Trail bridge shooting - Menasha, Wisconsin</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>6/11/2015. Venue type: other. Killed: 3. Injured: 1. Total victims: 4. Sergio Valencia del Toro, 27, in what officials say was a random act, shot and killed three people including an 11-year-old girl before turning the gun on himself. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://fox6now.com/2015/06/11/released-menasha-police-issue-final-report-on-trestle-trail-bridge-shooting/ and http://ww....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2015-06-11</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-88.46754,44.20412,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Charleston Church Shooting - Charleston, South Carolina</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>6/17/2015. Venue type: religious. Killed: 9. Injured: 1. Total victims: 10. Dylann Storm Roof, 21, shot and killed 9 people after opening fire at the Emanuel AME Church in Charleston, South Carolina. According to a roommate, he had allegedly been “planning something like that for six months.&quot; Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.motherjones.com/politics/2015/06/dylann-roofs-attorney; http://www.newsweek.com/report-nine-shot-charleston-s....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2015-06-17</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-79.93314,32.78839,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Chattanooga military recruitment center - Chattanooga, Tennessee</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>7/16/2015. Venue type: military. Killed: 5. Injured: 2. Total victims: 7. Kuwaiti-born Mohammod Youssuf Abdulazeez, 24, a naturalized US citizen, opened fire at a Naval reserve center, and then drove to a military recruitment office where he shot and killed four Marines and a Navy service member, and wounded a police officer and another military service member. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.reuters.com/article/2015/07/16/us-usa-shooting-tennessee-idUSKCN0PQ1WY20150716; http://www.nytimes.com/2015/0....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2015-07-16</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-85.31182,35.04716,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Umpqua Community College shooting - Roseburg, Oregon</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>10/1/2015. Venue type: school. Killed: 9. Injured: 9. Total victims: 18. 26-year-old Chris Harper Mercer opened fire at Umpqua Community College in southwest Oregon. The gunman shot himself to death after being wounded in a shootout with police. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/2015/10/03/us/chris-harper-mercer-umpqua-community-college-shooting.html; http://www.latimes.com/....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2015-10-01</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-123.33319,43.28954,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Colorado Springs shooting rampage - Colorado Springs, Colorado</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>10/31/2015. Venue type: other. Killed: 3. Injured: 0. Total victims: 3. Noah Harpham, 33, shot three people dead in Colorado Springs before police killed him in a shootout. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.motherjones.com/mojo/2015/11/open-carry-mass-shooting-colorado-springs and http://www.denverpost.com/news/ci_....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2015-10-31</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-104.81425,38.83755,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Planned Parenthood clinic - Colorado Springs, Colorado</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>11/27/2015. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 9. Total victims: 12. Robert Lewis Dear, 57, shot and killed a police officer and two citizens when he opened fire at a Planned Parenthood health clinic in Colorado Springs, Colorado. Nine others were wounded. Dear was arrested after an hours-long standoff with police. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/2015/11/28/us/colorado-planned-parenthood-shooting.html and http://www.cnn.com/2015/12/09/us/colo....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2015-11-27</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-104.84906,38.88103,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>San Bernardino mass shooting - San Bernardino, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>12/2/2015. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 14. Injured: 21. Total victims: 35. Syed Rizwan Farook left a Christmas party held at Inland Regional Center, later returning with Tashfeen Malik and the two opened fire, killing 14 and wounding 21, ten critically. The two were later killed by police as they fled in an SUV. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.motherjones.com/mojo/2015/12/san-bernardino-shooting and http://www.cnbc.com/2015/12/03/san-bernardino-shooti....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2015-12-02</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-117.27789,34.07596,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Kalamazoo shooting spree - Kalamazoo County, Michigan</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>2/20/2016. Venue type: other. Killed: 6. Injured: 2. Total victims: 8. Jason B. Dalton, a driver for Uber, apparently selected his victims randomly as he went on a rampage over several hours in three different locations, including five people he shot in the parking lot of a Cracker Barrel restaurant. He was &quot;arrested without incident&quot; at a downtown Kalamazoo bar about six hours after the rampage began. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/2016/02/22/us/kalamazoo-michigan-random-shootings.html; http://www.mlive.com/news/kalamazoo/index....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2016-02-20</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-85.6748,42.23669,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Excel Industries mass shooting - Hesston, Kansas</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>2/25/2016. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 14. Total victims: 17. Cedric L. Ford, who worked as a painter at a manufacturing company, shot victims from his car and at his workplace before being killed by police at the scene. Shortly before the rampage he had been served with a restraining order. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/2016/02/26/us/shooting-at-plant-hesston-kansas.html; https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/morning-....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2016-02-25</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-97.42515,38.13599,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Orlando nightclub massacre - Orlando, Florida</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>6/12/2016. Venue type: other. Killed: 49. Injured: 53. Total victims: 102. Omar Mateen, 29, attacked the Pulse nighclub in Orlando in the early morning hours of June 12. He was killed by law enforcement who raided the club after a prolonged standoff. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.motherjones.com/politics/2016/06/assault-rifle-used-by-orlando-mass-shooter; http://wrbl.com/2016/06/13/orlan....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2016-06-12</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-81.37678,28.51972,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Dallas police shooting - Dallas, Texas</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>7/7/2016. Venue type: other. Killed: 5. Injured: 11. Total victims: 16. Micah Xavier Johnson, a 25-year-old Army veteran, targeted police at a peaceful Black Lives Matter protest, killing five officers and injuring nine others as well as two civilians. After a prolonged standoff in a downtown building, law enforcement killed Johnson using a robot-delivered bomb. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/2016/07/11/us/dallas-shooting-micah-johnson-police.html?_r=0; http://www.wsj.com/articles/dallas-....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2016-07-07</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-96.80001,32.78011,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Baton Rouge police shooting - Baton Rouge, Louisiana</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>7/17/2016. Venue type: other. Killed: 3. Injured: 3. Total victims: 6. Gavin Long, 29, a former Marine who served in Iraq, killed three police offers responding to a 911 call, and wounded three others. He was killed in a shoot-out with other officers responding to the scene. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://time.com/4411027/baton-rouge-shooter-gavin-long/ ; http://www.nytimes.com/2016/07/18/us/baton-rouge-shooting.html....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2016-07-17</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-91.0814,30.4336,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Cascade Mall shooting - Burlington, Washington</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>9/23/2016. Venue type: other. Killed: 5. Injured: 0. Total victims: 5. Arcan Cetin, 20, killed a teen girl and three women in the cosmetics section of a Macy’s department store at the Cascade Mall. A man was critically wounded in the shooting and taken to Harborview Medical Center in Seattle, where he died. Cetin was apprehended by police a few hours after the shooting while driving a car near his residence. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/2016/09/25/us/mall-shooting-washington-state.html; https://www.seattletimes.com/seattle-news/crim....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2016-09-23</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-122.33792,48.46137,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Fort Lauderdale airport shooting - Fort Lauderdale, Florida</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>1/6/2017. Venue type: airport. Killed: 5. Injured: 6. Total victims: 11. Esteban Santiago, 26, flew from Alaska to Fort Lauderdale, where he opened fire in the baggage claim area of the airport, killing five and wounding six before police aprehended him. (Numerous other people were reportedly injured while fleeing during the panic.) Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nytimes.com/2017/01/07/us/esteban-santiago-fort-lauderdale-airport-shooting-.html?_r=0.</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-01-06</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-80.14338,26.07275,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Fresno downtown shooting - Fresno, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>4/18/2017. Venue type: other. Killed: 3. Injured: 0. Total victims: 3. Kori Ali Muhammad, 39, opened fire along a street in downtown Fresno, killing three people randomly in an alleged hate crime prior to being apprehended by police. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-4443722/Gunman-Fresno-shooting-speaks-jail.html; https://www.nytimes.com/2017/04....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-04-18</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-119.80032,36.74638,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Rural Ohio nursing home shooting - Kirkersville, Ohio</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>5/12/2017. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 0. Total victims: 3. Thomas Hartless, 43, shot and killed a former girlfriend and another employee of a nursing home, and fatally shot the Kirkersville police chief responding to the scene. Hartless&#x27; former girlfriend had recently obtained a court protection order against Hartless. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://abc6onyourside.com/news/local/report-of-shooting-in-kirkersville; http://www.cbsnews.com/news/64-guns-seized-from....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-05-12</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-82.59651,39.95903,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Florida awning manufacturer shooting - Orlando, Florida</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>6/5/2017. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 5. Injured: 0. Total victims: 5. John Robert Neumann, Jr., 45, a former employee of manufacturer Fiamma Inc. fatally shot five workers at the company, and then killed himself on the scene. He&#x27;d been fired from the company in April. The attack took place a week before the one-year anniversary of the Orlando nightclub massacre. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.postandcourier.com/news/multiple-people-dead-following-shooting-near-orlando-monday-morning/article_918fe64c-....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-06-05</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-81.29409,28.58029,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Pennsylvania supermarket shooting - Tunkhannock, Pennsylvania</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>6/7/17. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 0. Total victims: 3. Randy Stair, a 24-year-old worker at Weis grocery fatally shot three of his fellow employees. He reportedly fired 59 rounds with a pair of shotguns before turning the gun on himself as another co-worker fled the scene for help and law enforcement responded. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.pressconnects.com/story/news/local/pennsylvania/2017/06/08/dead-murder-suicide-pa-weis/102621742/; https://ww....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-06-07</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-75.94722,41.52955,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>San Francisco UPS shooting - San Francisco, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>6/14/17. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 2. Total victims: 5. Jimmy Lam, 38, fatally shot three coworkers and wounded two others inside a UPS facility in San Francisco. Lam killed himself as law enforcement officers responded to the scene. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.nbcbayarea.com/news/local/Active-Shooter-San-Francisco-Police-428441423.html; https://apnews.com/2c1690393510....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-06-14</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-122.40609,37.76595,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Las Vegas Strip massacre - Las Vegas, Nevada</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>10/1/17. Venue type: other. Killed: 60. Injured: 546 (MJ figure; official: about 867, 413+ by gunfire or shrapnel). Total victims: 606. Stephen Craig Paddock, 64, fired a barrage of rapid gunfire—using semiautomatic rifles modified with &quot;bump stocks&quot;—at thousands of concertgoers on the Las Vegas Strip late on a Sunday night; Paddock had positioned himself in a corner suite on the 32nd floor of the Mandalay Bay Resort and Casino, where he took aim from windows he&#x27;d smashed... Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.lvmpd.com/en-us/Documents/1_October_FIT_Report_01-18-2018_Footnoted.pdf; https://www.nytimes.com/2017/10/02/....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-10-01</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-115.17154,36.09574,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Edgewood business park shooting - Edgewood, Maryland</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>10/18/17. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 3. Total victims: 6. Radee Labeeb Prince, 37, fatally shot three people and wounded two others around 9am at Advance Granite Solutions, a home remodeling business where he worked near Baltimore. Hours later he shot and wounded a sixth person at a car dealership in Wilmington, Delaware. He was apprehended that evening following a manhunt by authorities. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.baltimoresun.com/news/maryland/harford/aegis/ph-ag-edgewood-shooting-20171018-story.html; http://www.cnn.com/....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-10-18</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-76.30999,39.45219,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Walmart shooting in suburban Denver - Thornton, Colorado</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>11/1/17. Venue type: other. Killed: 3. Injured: 0. Total victims: 3. Scott Allen Ostrem, 47, walked into a Walmart in a suburb north of Denver and fatally shot two men and a woman, then left the store and drove away. After an all-night manhunt, Ostrem, who had financial problems but no serious criminal history, was captured by police after being spotted near his apartment in Denver. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.nytimes.com/2017/11/01/us/thornton-colorado-walmart-shooting.html; http://www.cnn.com/2017/11/01/us/colorado....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-11-01</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-104.98613,39.87637,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Texas First Baptist Church massacre - Sutherland Springs, Texas</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>11/5/17. Venue type: religious. Killed: 26. Injured: 20. Total victims: 46. Devin Patrick Kelley, a 26-year-old ex-US Air Force airman, opened fire at the First Baptist Church in Sutherland Springs during Sunday morning services, killing at least 26 people and wounding and injuring 20 others. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/morning-mix/wp/2017/11/06/who-is-devin-patrick-kelley-gunman-who-officials-say-kille....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-11-05</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-98.05649,29.27328,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Rancho Tehama shooting spree - Rancho Tehama, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>11/14/17. Venue type: other. Killed: 5. Injured: 10. Total victims: 15. Kevin Janson Neal, 44, went on an approximately 45-minute shooting spree in the rural community of Rancho Tehama Reserve in Northern California, including shooting up an elementary school, before being killed by law enforcement officers. Neal had also killed his wife at home. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/california-mass-shooter-killed-wife-buried-her-beneath-floor-n821051; https://www.n....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2017-11-14</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-122.39309,40.01876,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Pennsylvania carwash shooting - Melcroft, Pennsylvania</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>1/28/18. Venue type: other. Killed: 4. Injured: 1. Total victims: 5. Timothy O&#x27;Brien Smith, 28, wearing body armor and well-stocked with ammo, opened fire at a carwash early in the morning in this rural community, killing four people. A fifth victim, though not shot, suffered minor injuries. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.wpxi.com/news/top-stories/family-members-small-community-in-shock-after-4-killed-in-shooting/690497960; http:....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-01-28</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-79.38917,40.05215,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Marjory Stoneman Douglas High School shooting - Parkland, Florida</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>2/14/18. Venue type: school. Killed: 17. Injured: 17. Total victims: 34. Nikolas J. Cruz, 19, heavily armed with an AR-15, tactical gear, and “countless magazines” of ammo, according to the Broward County Sheriff, attacked the high school as classes were ending for the day, killing at least 17 people and injuring many others. He was apprehended by authorities shortly after fleeing the campus. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/14/us/parkland-school-shooting.html; https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/15/us/nikolas-cruz-....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-02-14</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-80.26951,26.30483,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Yountville veterans home shooting - Yountville, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>3/9/18. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 0. Total victims: 3. Army veteran Albert Cheung Wong, 36, stormed a veterans home where he was previously under care, exchanging gunfire with a sheriff’s deputy and taking three women hostage, one of whom he’d previously threatened. After a standoff with law enforcement, he killed the three women and himself. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.cnn.com/2018/03/10/us/california-veterans-home-shooting/index.html; http://www.ktvu.com/news/gunman-in-yount....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-03-09</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-122.36653,38.3925,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Waffle House shooting - Nashville, Tennessee</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>4/22/18. Venue type: other. Killed: 4. Injured: 4. Total victims: 8. Travis Reinking, 29, opened fire around 3:30 a.m. in the parking lot of a Waffle House in Antioch, and continued shooting as he entered the restaurant. As he attempted to reload his AR-15, a bystander heroically wrestled the rifle away from Reinking, who then fled; he was captured by authorities the following day. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/post-nation/wp/2018/04/23/waffle-house-shooting-travis-reinking-manhunt-continues-na....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-04-22</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-86.61694,36.05252,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Santa Fe High School shooting - Santa Fe, Texas</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>5/18/18. Venue type: school. Killed: 10. Injured: 13. Total victims: 23. Dimitrios Pagourtzis, a 17-year-old student, opened fire at Santa Fe High School with a shotgun and .38 revolver owned by his father; Pagourtzis killed 10 and injured at least 13 others before surrendering to authorities after a standoff and additional gunfire inside the school. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.chron.com/news/houston-texas/article/Shots-fired-at-Santa-Fe-High-School-12925050.php; https://www.nytimes.c....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-05-18</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-95.14197,29.39282,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Capital Gazette shooting - Annapolis, Maryland</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>6/28/18. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 5. Injured: 2. Total victims: 7. Jarrod W. Ramos, 38, shot through the glass doors of the paper’s newsroom around 3pm to carry out his attack; police quickly responding to the scene found him hiding under a desk and apprehended him. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.capitalgazette.com/news/annapolis/bs-md-gazette-shooting-20180628-story.html; http://www.capitalgazette.com/n....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-06-28</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-76.54366,38.99455,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Fifth Third Center shooting - Cincinnati, Ohio</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>9/6/18. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 2. Total victims: 5. Omar Enrique Santa Perez, 29, walked into the ground-floor lobby of a building in downtown Cincinnati shortly after 9 a.m. and opened fire. Within minutes, Perez was fatally wounded in a shootout with law enforcement officers responding to the scene. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.cnn.com/2018/09/07/us/cincinnati-shooting/index.html; https://www.cincinnati.com/story/news/crime/crime-and-....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-09-06</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-84.51178,39.10198,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>T&amp;T Trucking shooting - Bakersfield, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>9/12/18. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 5. Injured: 0. Total victims: 5. Javier Casarez, 54, who was going through a bitter divorce, went on a shooting spree targeting his ex-wife and former coworkers at the trucking company. His attack included fatally shooting one victim who he pursued to a nearby sporting goods retailer, and two others at a private residence. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.latimes.com/local/lanow/la-me-bakersfield-mass-shooting-20180914-story.html; https://www.cnn.com/2018/09/13/u....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-09-12</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-118.91634,35.34939,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Rite Aid warehouse shooting - Perryman, Maryland</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>9/20/18. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 3. Total victims: 6. Snochia Moseley, 26, reportedly a disgruntled employee, shot her victims outside the building and on the warehouse floor; she later died from a self-inflicted gunshot at a nearby hospital. (No law enforcement officers responding to her attack fired shots.) Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.baltimoresun.com/news/maryland/crime/bs-md-harford-shooting-20180920-story.html; https://www.washingtonpost.c....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-09-20</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-76.20848,39.45566,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Tree of Life synagogue shooting - Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>10/27/18. Venue type: religious. Killed: 11. Injured: 6. Total victims: 17. Robert D. Bowers, 46, shouted anti-Semitic slurs as he opened fire inside the Tree of Life synagogue during Saturday morning worship. He was armed with an assault rifle and multiple handguns and was apprehended after a standoff with police. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.nytimes.com/2018/10/27/us/active-shooter-pittsburgh-synagogue-shooting.html; https://www.cnn.com/us/live-new....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-10-27</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-79.9214,40.4439,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Thousand Oaks nightclub shooting - Thousand Oaks, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>11/7/18. Venue type: other. Killed: 12. Injured: 22. Total victims: 34. Ian David Long, 28, dressed in black and armed with a handgun and a “smoke device,” approached the Borderline Bar &amp; Grill — a country music venue popular with college students — close to midnight and opened fire, killing a security guard and then others in the club, including a sheriff’s deputy responding to the attack. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.latimes.com/local/lanow/la-me-ln-thousand-oaks-20181107-story.html; https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/201....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-11-07</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-118.87479,34.17695,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Mercy Hospital shooting - Chicago, Illinois</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>11/19/18. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 3. Injured: 0. Total victims: 3. Juan Lopez, 32, confronted his former fiancé, ER doctor Tamara O&#x27;Neal, before shooting her and opening fire on others at the hospital, including a responding police officer, Samuel Jimenez, and a pharmacy employee, Dayna Less. Lopez was fatally shot by a responding SWAT officer. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.cnn.com/2018/11/19/us/mercy-hospital-chicago-shooting/index.html; https://www.chicagotribune.com/news/local/....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2018-11-19</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-87.62201,41.84767,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>SunTrust bank shooting - Sebring, Florida</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>1/23/19. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 5. Injured: 0. Total victims: 5. Zephen A. Xaver, 21, fatally shot five women inside a bank and then called the police to confess. He was armed with a handgun and wore a bulletproof vest. He reportedly ordered the women to lie down on the floor and shot them execution-style. After a standoff with police, he surrendered and was taken into custody. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://wsbt.com/news/local/classmate-says-florida-bank-shooter-who-allegedly-killed-5-attended-bremen-high-school; http....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2019-01-23</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-81.45847,27.47104,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Pennsylvania hotel bar shooting - State College, Pennsylvania</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>1/24/19. Venue type: other. Killed: 3. Injured: 1. Total victims: 4. Jordan Witmer, 21, shot three people at a Ramada Hotel bar near Penn State University, including a former girlfriend he was there with. He then fled the bar, crashed his car about a mile away, and stormed into a random house, fatally shooting an elderly resident and then himself. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: http://www.wistv.com/2019/01/26/details-emerge-about-shooting-rampage-near-penn-state/; https://www.pennlive.com/news/20....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2019-01-24</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-77.83941,40.78514,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Harry Pratt Co. warehouse shooting - Aurora, Illinois</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>2/15/19. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 5. Injured: 6. Total victims: 11. Gary Martin, 45, went on a rampage inside the warehouse in response to being fired from his job and died soon thereafter in a shootout with police. Among his victims were five dead coworkers and five injured police officers. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2019/02/16/man-kills-five-warehouse-shooting-spree-shortly-after-being-fired-illin....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2019-02-15</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-88.33106,41.75373,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Virginia Beach municipal building shooting - Virginia Beach, Virginia</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>5/31/19. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 12. Injured: 4. Total victims: 16. DeWayne Craddock, 40, a municipal city worker wielding handguns, a suppressor and high-capacity magazines, killed en masse inside a Virginia Beach muncipal building late in the day on a Friday, before dying in a prolonged gun battle with police. Craddock reportedly had submitted his resignation from his job that morning. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.washingtonpost.com/local/public-safety/virginia-beach-officials-expect-to-release-additional-details-of-mass....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2019-05-31</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-76.06038,36.75442,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Gilroy garlic festival shooting - Gilroy, California</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>7/28/19. Venue type: other. Killed: 3. Injured: 12. Total victims: 15. Santino William LeGan, 19, fired indiscriminately into the crowd near a concert stage at the festival. He used an AK-47-style rifle, purchased legally in Nevada three weeks earlier. After apparently pausing to reload, he fired additional multiple rounds before police shot him and then he killed himself. Source: Mother Jones mass-shootings dataset (1982-2026); row sources: https://www.cbsnews.com/live-news/garlic-festival-mass-shooting-gilroy-california-victims-suspect-santino-william-legan-....</p><p><a href="https://www.b0b.dev/report#X">View in report</a></p>]]></description><TimeStamp><when>2019-07-28</when></TimeStamp><Point><coordinates>-121.58482,36.99719,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>El Paso Walmart mass shooting - El Paso, Texas</name><styleUrl>#t-mass-shooting</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p><b>Mass shootings</b> &middot; mass-shooting</p><p>8/3/19. Venue type: workplace. Killed: 23. Injured: 22. Total victims: 45. Patrick Crusius, 21, who was apprehended by police, posted a so-called manifesto online shortly before the attack espousing